    participant PD as Provider DP
    end
    box rgb(240,234,250) TAU VM 2 - data source
    participant S as Data source
    end

    Note over R,S: Cloud: provider CP and DP on cPouta
    Note over R,S: Network RTT: consumer to provider CP 46 ms | provider CP to DP same host | provider DP to source 8 ms | consumer to provider DP 46 ms
    Note over R,S: Pull, EDC wait 50 ms, 4 CPU / 4 GB per connector

    rect rgb(220,235,255)
    Note over R,S: TC1: control signal, 272 B (source /tc1/control-signal)
    R->>CC: Catalog request
    CC->>PC: Catalog request (DSP)
    PC-->>CC: Catalog with offers
    CC-->>R: Catalog with offers
    Note over CC,PC: 1) Catalog: 921 ms
    R->>CC: Start negotiation
    CC->>PC: Contract request
    PC-->>CC: Contract agreement
    CC->>PC: Verify agreement
    PC-->>CC: Agreement finalized
    loop negotiationPoll
        R->>CC: Poll state, every 0.1 s
    end
    Note over CC,PC: 2) Negotiation: 2,487 ms
    R->>CC: Start pull transfer
    CC->>PC: Transfer request
    PC->>PD: Start data flow
    PD-->>PC: Endpoint and token
    PC-->>CC: Transfer start, token
    loop edrPoll
        R->>CC: Poll endpoint and token
    end
    Note over CC,PC: 3a) Transfer setup, once: 587 ms
    loop 30 fetches
        R->>CD: GET data of the transfer, no token
        opt first fetch only
            CD->>CC: Get endpoint and token
            CC-->>CD: Endpoint and token
        end
        CD->>PD: GET data with token
        PD->>S: GET payload
        S-->>PD: Payload
        PD-->>CD: Payload
        CD-->>R: Payload
    end
    Note over CD,S: 3b) Fetch: 96.0 ms median, first 574.2 ms
    Note over R,S: Total TC1 to first data: 4,569 ms
    end

